
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>500 techniques de Naruto</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;padding:20px 14px;
 background:#080808;color:white;
 font-family:Arial,sans-serif
}
main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}
h1{text-align:center;color:#ff3838}
.intro{text-align:center;color:#bbb;line-height:1.5}
#recherche{
 width:100%;padding:14px;background:#151515;
 color:white;border:2px solid #555;
 border-radius:8px;font-size:16px
}
.filtres{
 display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;
 justify-content:center;gap:9px;margin:20px 0
}
.filtre{
 padding:12px 19px;background:#191919;
 color:white;border:1px solid #555;
 border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold
}
.filtre.actif{background:#ff3838;border-color:#ff3838}
#compteur{text-align:center;color:#bbb}
#liste{
 display:grid;
 grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(270px,1fr));
 gap:14px
}
.technique{
 padding:15px;background:#151515;
 border:1px solid #444;border-left:5px solid #ff3838;
 border-radius:9px
}
.technique h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 12px}
.technique p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#ddd}
.categorie{color:#ffaaaa!important;font-weight:bold}
.mudras{
 background:#241832;padding:10px;
 border:1px solid #7546a8;border-radius:7px;
 color:#e2caff!important
}
.chakra{color:#39aaff!important;font-weight:bold}
.barre{
 width:100%;height:7px;background:#333;
 border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden
}
.progression{
 height:100%;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,#168cff,#ff3838)
}
.type{
 display:inline-block;background:#292929;
 color:#ffbb66;padding:5px 8px;
 border-radius:5px;font-size:11px;margin-top:10px
}
.vide{text-align:center;color:#aaa}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<main>

<h1>500 techniques de Naruto</h1>

<p class="intro">
Encyclopédie des techniques ninja : noms français,
descriptions, mudras et coûts de chakra.
</p>

<div class="filtres">
<button class="filtre actif" data-filtre="Tous">Tous</button>
<button class="filtre" data-filtre="Feu">Katon</button>
<button class="filtre" data-filtre="Vent">Fūton</button>
<button class="filtre" data-filtre="Foudre">Raiton</button>
<button class="filtre" data-filtre="Eau">Suiton</button>
<button class="filtre" data-filtre="Terre">Doton</button>
<button class="filtre" data-filtre="Sceaux">Sceaux</button>
</div>

<input id="recherche" type="search"
placeholder="Rechercher une technique, un mudra ou un élément...">

<p id="compteur"></p>
<section id="liste"></section>

</main>

